nificant drop in end market demand late in the fourth quarter of 2018.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/06/sensata-technologies-holding-nv-st-q4-2018-earning.aspx"},{"c":"ST 2018 Q4","e":"st","d":"2019-02-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Martha Sullivan","x":"This highly variable cost structure enables us to take cost out of the business quickly and limit the decremental margins that peers with higher fixed costs typically see when volumes decline.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/06/sensata-technologies-holding-nv-st-q4-2018-earning.aspx"},{"c":"ST 2018 Q4","e":"st","d":"2019-02-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul Vasington","x":"So in our press release, you can see what we're thinking about in terms of restructuring for 2019.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/06/sensata-technologies-holding-nv-st-q4-2018-earning.aspx"},{"c":"ST 2019 Q1","e":"st","d":"2019-05-01","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Christopher Glynn","x":"I had a question about new product launches by automotive OEM customers, and curious to how you think about the impact of trade and tariff uncertainty because the major OEMs have global production, some local for local, some not and they have to decide how to allocate production.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/01/sensata-technologies-holding-nv-st-q1-2019-earning.aspx"},{"c":"ST 2019 Q1","e":"st","d":"2019-05-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Martha N. Sullivan","x":"Second, we are aligning our cost base with the lower volumes we are seeing in the business and executing initiatives to further streamline our operations.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/01/sensata-technologies-holding-nv-st-q1-2019-earning.aspx"},{"c":"ST 2019 Q1","e":"st","d":"2019-05-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul Vasington","x":"…doing that whether it's reducing material costs through working with suppliers or design-driven cost savings or increasing the productivity or managing our network to be the most optimized and efficient it can be; all those activities go into driving cost out of the product every year. And we…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/01/sensata-technologies-holding-nv-st-q1-2019-earning.aspx"},{"c":"ST 2019 Q1","e":"st","d":"2019-05-01","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Paul Vasington","x":"The lower outlook in Auto is driven by weaker-than-expected end-markets in Europe and China.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/01/sensata-technologies-holding-nv-st-q1-2019-earning.aspx"},{"c":"ST 2019 Q2","e":"st","d":"2019-07-30","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Paul Vasington","x":"Adjusted operating income was $205.1 million in the quarter, a decrease of 6.5% compared to the second quarter of 2018, due primarily to the net effect of acquisitions and divestitures, net productivity headwinds partly related to scaling new product launches and higher tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/30/sensata-technologies-holding-nv-st-q2-2019-earning.aspx"},{"c":"ST 2019 Q2","e":"st","d":"2019-07-30","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Paul Vasington","x":"The decline in segment operating income and margin was primarily driven by the net effect of acquisitions and divestitures, productivity headwinds related -- probably related to scaling new products and higher tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/30/sensata-technologies-holding-nv-st-q2-2019-earning.aspx"},{"c":"ST 2019 Q2","e":"st","d":"2019-07-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul Vasington","x":"We mentioned earlier that we are implementing additional actions to streamline and align our cost structure to the lower market demand, as well to improve productivity.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/30/sensata-technologies-holding-nv-st-q2-2019-earning.aspx"},{"c":"ST 2019 Q2","e":"st","d":"2019-07-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul Vasington","x":"These actions will include a voluntary retirement program, further site consolidation and other restructuring actions to further reduce our costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/30/sensata-technologies-holding-nv-st-q2-2019-earning.aspx"},{"c":"ST 2019 Q2","e":"st","d":"2019-07-30","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Martha Sullivan","x":"That is our assumption and our -- one of the things that drives a reduced outlook from Sensata for the China auto market.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/30/sensata-technologies-holding-nv-st-q2-2019-earning.aspx"},{"c":"ST 2019 Q3","e":"st","d":"2019-10-30","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Martha Sullivan","x":"Our industrial performance in China is particularly weak as a result of global tariff and trade actions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/30/sensata-technologies-holding-nv-st-q3-2019-earning.aspx"},{"c":"ST 2019 Q3","e":"st","d":"2019-10-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul Vasington","x":"So we, as we mentioned in the last call, we've done a lot of restructuring in Q2.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/30/sensata-technologies-holding-nv-st-q3-2019-earning.aspx"},{"c":"ST 2019 Q3","e":"st","d":"2019-10-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul Vasington","x":"There was more restructuring in Q3.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/30/sensata-technologies-holding-nv-st-q3-2019-earning.aspx"},{"c":"ST 2019 Q4","e":"st","d":"2020-02-11","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul Vasington","x":"Productivity headwinds partly due to increasing new product launches, and greater design and development effort to support new business wins in megatrend growth initiatives, somewhat offset by savings from restructuring actions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/11/sensata-technologies-holding-nv-st-q4-2019-earning.aspx"},{"c":"ST 2019 Q4","e":"st","d":"2020-02-11","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul Vasington","x":"SG&A costs were $267.4 million or 8.6% lower year-over-year, due primarily to lower variable compensation and selling costs favorable foreign currency and cost savings from repositioning actions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/11/sensata-technologies-holding-nv-st-q4-2019-earning.aspx"},{"c":"ST 2020 Q1","e":"st","d":"2020-04-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jeffrey Cote","x":"We have proven ourselves as good stewards of capital, rightsizing our organization to the environment, yet still investing in areas that offer significant long-term growth opportunities.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/29/sensata-technologies-holding-nv-st-q1-2020-earning.aspx"},{"c":"ST 2020 Q1","e":"st","d":"2020-04-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul Vasington","x":"The decline in segment operating income was primarily due to lower revenues, manufacturing facilities operating at significantly lower capacity and unfavorable product mix somewhat offset by savings from restructuring actions taken last year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/29/sensata-technologies-holding-nv-st-q1-2020-earning.aspx"},{"c":"ST 2020 Q1","e":"st","d":"2020-04-29","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Paul Vasington","x":"As announced earlier this month, we have withdrawn our full-year guidance as a negative impact of the COVID-19 pandemic on our business remains highly uncertain, quickly changing and unpredictable.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/29/sensata-technologies-holding-nv-st-q1-2020-earning.aspx"},{"c":"ST 2020 Q2","e":"st","d":"2020-07-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul Vasington","x":"…operating income is due primarily to lower revenues, manufacturing facilities operating at significantly lower capacity and elevated operating costs related to COVID-19, somewhat offset by temporary cost reductions in the quarter as well as savings from restructuring actions taken last year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/28/sensata-technologies-holding-nv-st-q2-2020-earning.aspx"},{"c":"ST 2020 Q2","e":"st","d":"2020-07-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul Vasington","x":"…in segment operating income was primarily due to lower revenues, manufacturing facilities operating at significantly lower capacity and elevated operating costs related to COVID-19, somewhat offset by temporary cost reductions in the quarter and savings from restructuring actions taken last year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/28/sensata-technologies-holding-nv-st-q2-2020-earning.aspx"},{"c":"ST 2020 Q2","e":"st","d":"2020-07-28","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Paul Vasington","x":"In April, we withdrew our full year guidance as the negative impact of the COVID-19 pandemic created great uncertainty and unpredictability for our business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/28/sensata-technologies-holding-nv-st-q2-2020-earning.aspx"},{"c":"ST 2020 Q3","e":"st","d":"2020-10-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jacob Sayer","x":"We are aligning our cost structure to demand levels through a restructuring program and cost controls, expected to generate savings of $60 million to $65 million next year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/27/sensata-technologies-holding-nv-st-q3-2020-earning/"},{"c":"ST 2020 Q3","e":"st","d":"2020-10-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul Vasington","x":"Primarily due to lower revenues, lower productivity in our manufacturing operations, revenue mix, and higher incentive compensation aligned to improved financial performance, partially offset by savings from cost reduction programs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/27/sensata-technologies-holding-nv-st-q3-2020-earning/"},{"c":"ST 2020 Q4","e":"st","d":"2021-02-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jeffrey J. Cote","x":"We continue to benefit from incremental savings from the restructuring program announced last summer.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/02/sensata-technologies-holding-nv-st-q4-2020-earning/"},{"c":"ST 2020 Q4","e":"st","d":"2021-02-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul S. Vasington","x":"…of 1.6% compared to the fourth quarter of 2019, primarily due to higher revenues, savings from cost reduction programs and favorable foreign currency, partially offset by elevated costs resulting from the COVID-19 pandemic, higher incentive compensation aligned to improved financial…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/02/sensata-technologies-holding-nv-st-q4-2020-earning/"},{"c":"ST 2021 Q1","e":"st","d":"2021-04-27","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Amit Daryanani","x":"So I'm curious what is your ability to pass price increases to your customer to offset some of these challenges over here?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/27/sensata-technologies-holding-nv-st-q1-2021-earning/"},{"c":"ST 2021 Q1","e":"st","d":"2021-04-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul Vasington","x":"…of 44.9% compared to the first quarter 2020, primarily due to higher revenues, savings from cost reduction programs, and favorable foreign currency, partially offset by elevated costs related to the industry wide semiconductor chip shortage, higher spend support Megatrend growth…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/27/sensata-technologies-holding-nv-st-q1-2021-earning/"},{"c":"ST 2021 Q1","e":"st","d":"2021-04-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul Vasington","x":"The increase in segment operating income was primarily due to higher revenues, savings from cost reduction actions, and favorable foreign currency somewhat offset by elevated costs, related to the industry wide semiconductor chip shortage.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/27/sensata-technologies-holding-nv-st-q1-2021-earning/"},{"c":"ST 2021 Q2","e":"st","d":"2021-07-27","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Matt Sheerin","x":"And then in terms of passing through those costs, how are those discussions with customers going?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/27/sensata-technologies-holding-plc-st-q2-2021-earnin/"},{"c":"ST 2021 Q3","e":"st","d":"2021-10-26","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Nikolay Todorov","x":"And maybe can you talk about how much of the installation costs you've seen so far, you've been able to pass through to direct customers so far this year, and how should investors think about once we start the new calendar year in terms of passing through those?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/26/sensata-technologies-holding-plc-st-q3-2021-earnin/"},{"c":"ST 2024 Q3","e":"st","d":"2024-11-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Martha Sullivan","x":"Third, we commenced several operational improvement initiatives focused on streamlining process, increasing automation, reducing overhead expense and aligning capital expenditures to a lower market reality.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/22/sensata-st-q3-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ST 2024 Q3","e":"st","d":"2024-11-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Martha Sullivan","x":"Another area I would talk about is design-driven cost reduction.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/22/sensata-st-q3-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ST 2024 Q4","e":"st","d":"2025-02-11","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Brian Roberts","x":"Our Q1 2025 guidance and full-year 2025 outlook excludes any potential impacts from recently announced tariffs on imports in